            "review_title": "Review at Di Nam Sa Dec",
            "review_text": "dmshep66\nCaistor, United Kingdom240 contributions\n0\nLate lunch\nAug 2019 • Family\nFound this place very close to our Homestay and decided to give it a go. The place is quite small, with roof fans and clean, wooden tables. The menu is very limited, but what they do, they do very well. A menu shows accurate photos but there isn't much English spoken.\nGreat noodle dishes with a range of veg and meat and seafood.\nI might have gone 5 star, but we ordered 4 noodle dishes, 2 dry and 2 soup, but we got 3 soups. Minor detail.\nDon't be put off. A great little place.\nRead more\nWritten August 13, 2019",
            "rating": 5.0,
